#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD2015 expect=noViolation domain=CE
#note "CE is in the rule's Domains scope and --SOC resolves to CESOC (Events-class model Variable Qualifier). Every populated CESOC is a System Organ Class of the (dummy) MedDRA dictionary. The PMDA sheet says Case-insensitive, so the rule authors case_sensitive: false (D-TA-3 / Fix #266) and the upper-case variant passes too; the empty CESOC on row 3 does not fire."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
#dictionaries dummy
dataset CE
col USUBJID type=Char
col CESOC   type=Char
---
001 | Nervous system disorders
001 | GASTROINTESTINAL DISORDERS
002 |
